# Rye as stalks on every tilled field but Onar's north one (reports/content/2026-11-19-crop-fields/stalk.md, step C3):
# one strip of rye of each plot of the set built with seed 7 and the fields of the note, from 9 m over it along the
# strip and from a man's height beside it. Onar's north field: crop-onar-top.bench.
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> scripts/bench.sh crop-fields-stalks <out>
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode walk
watch player
